Updates:
 - Fixed the problems that freezes the game;
-  Other minor bugs were fixed;

Special Thanks for SkyStarMania

Release notes:


Height of the double jump was increased a little, this way, you can jump some platforms with ease;
 Speed ​​player was reduced; 
 Spikes behind the grasses was removed;
 At each level the timer was increased by 20 seconds.

New Updates: 

- Level 09 playable; 
- Now you can switch weapons while you playing;
- Added a new item for increase the  ammo of the weapons;
- Fixed minor bugs;

